{"seq":3,"slug":"retrieval-and-just-in-time-context","title":"检索与按需上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/retrieval-and-just-in-time-context","wordCount":1630,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"检索与按需上下文\">检索与按需上下文</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>既然窗口是稀缺预算，可扩展的供给方式就不是预测需求然后预装，而是<strong>给 agent 取用的能力，让它边工作边取</strong>。这已是主流实现的选择：Anthropic 明确描述 Claude Code 用 glob、grep 等检索基元在运行时导航并按需取回文件，从而绕开预建索引过期的问题（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents\">Effective context engineering for AI agents</a>）。本篇拆解预装与按需的权衡、协议层的按需投放通道，以及代码库一侧要做的配合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预装-vs-按需\">预装 vs 按需</h2><p>三种供给模式的系统对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>全量预装</th>\n<th>按需检索</th>\n<th>混合（常驻 + 按需）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>token 成本</td>\n<td>最高，随语料线性增长</td>\n<td>每次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为取回条数</td>\n<td>小型常驻头 + 查询增量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新鲜度</td>\n<td>快照时刻起持续过期</td>\n<td>总是最新</td>\n<td>常驻部分仍需人工维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型失效</td>\n<td>噪音淹没、撑爆窗口</td>\n<td>检索不准则满盘皆输</td>\n<td>继承两侧失效模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用语料</td>\n<td>小而稳定的规范集</td>\n<td>动态变化的大代码库</td>\n<td>高频小知识 + 低频大语料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Anthropic 的判断是：随着模型能力增强，agent 设计趋势偏向更多运行时探索、更少预先计算；但对法律、金融这类内容稳定又不容出错的领域，预建检索的混合策略仍有优势（同上工程文）。换言之，按需是默认起点而非教条。</p>\n<p>它的核心代价是<strong>延迟</strong>：每次探索都是一串真实的工具往返，比读内存里的预装答案慢。换来的是零索引维护成本与永不过期——对几周就重构一次目录的代码库，这笔交易几乎总是划算的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协议层的按需投放-mcp\">协议层的按需投放：MCP</h2><p>Model Context Protocol 把「上下文如何进入对话」规范化为两条语义不同的通道：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Resources 是 application-driven 的</strong>——规范原文如此定义：资源由宿主应用控制呈现方式，适合用户显式挑选、或应用按启发式自动注入的数据（<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2026-07-28/server/resources\">MCP 规范 Resources 章节</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>Tools 是 model-controlled 的</strong>——由模型在运行中自主决定何时调用（<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/tools\">MCP Tools 概念页</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这条区分正是 JIT 思想在协议层的落点：数据不必一开始就在窗口里，模型可以在需要的那一刻通过工具调用拉取。Claude Code 更进一步把 MCP 本身也 JIT 化了——<strong>MCP 工具定义默认延迟加载，只有工具名与服务说明常驻，模型通过 tool search 找到目标后才装载完整 schema</strong>（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/how-claude-code-works\">how-claude-code-works 文档</a>）。接入几十个 MCP server 时，这一项把常驻开销从「所有工具的全量定义」降到「一张可搜索的工具目录」。</p>\n<p>同类机制在整个生态普遍出现：Skills 只在会话开始暴露描述、被调用时才装载正文；sub-agent 在自己的独立窗口消化海量中间输出，只把摘要带回主对话（同上文档）；Gemini CLI 在工具访问某目录时向上扫描 JIT 上下文文件直至受信任根（<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/main/docs/cli/gemini-md.md\">gemini-cli 官方文档</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant M as 主上下文&#10;    participant T as 工具搜索&#10;    participant S as MCP Server&#10;    participant F as 文件系统&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;T: 需要能力X,查询工具目录&#10;    T--&gt;&gt;M: 候选工具名与简述&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;S: 调用选中工具,此刻才装载完整schema&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;M: 结果,可只返回摘要&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;F: 用glob/grep精确定位&#10;    F--&gt;&gt;M: 仅命中片段&#10;    Note over M: 窗口内只剩目录、命中结果与摘要\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as 主上下文\n    participant T as 工具搜索\n    participant S as MCP Server\n    participant F as 文件系统\n    M-&gt;&gt;T: 需要能力X,查询工具目录\n    T--&gt;&gt;M: 候选工具名与简述\n    M-&gt;&gt;S: 调用选中工具,此刻才装载完整schema\n    S--&gt;&gt;M: 结果,可只返回摘要\n    M-&gt;&gt;F: 用glob/grep精确定位\n    F--&gt;&gt;M: 仅命中片段\n    Note over M: 窗口内只剩目录、命中结果与摘要</pre><h2 id=\"让代码库支持高效检索\">让代码库支持高效检索</h2><p>按需供给的质量上限由代码库的可发现性决定，抓手有四个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可搜索性</strong>：一致术语与清晰命名让关键词检索命中率足够高；同义词混用会让 grep 型 agent 直接失明。</li>\n<li><strong>结构即索引</strong>：可预测的目录布局本身就是检索器，「顺着结构走」远比全文盲搜便宜。</li>\n<li><strong>入口地图</strong>：根目录放面向机器的内容索引。<a href=\"https://llmstxt.org/\">llms.txt 提案</a>主张用一份 Markdown 索引列出文档入口，供 LLM 快速定位该去哪找。</li>\n<li><strong>可关联性</strong>：显式相对链接与就近放置，让 agent 找到一处即可顺藤摸瓜，减少二次搜索次数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>检索质量对预算的影响可以直接量化。设一次查询取回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条、精度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则注入噪音约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)\\,k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条；平均每条占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 时，浪费预算的期望为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>waste</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{waste}} = (1-p)\\cdot k \\cdot \\bar{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">waste</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>精度从 0.9 掉到 0.5，浪费翻五倍。投资命名一致性与索引，本质上是在压这个式子里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略与边界\">策略与边界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>由浅入深加载</strong>：先读地图、README 与函数签名建立骨架，再深入命中的实现；一步到位读细节既慢又费预算。</li>\n<li><strong>核心常驻、其余按需</strong>：构建命令与硬约定进 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 常驻，长尾知识靠检索。判据是使用频率，不是重要程度。</li>\n<li><strong>警惕检索死循环</strong>：检索回大量无关内容等于换一种方式塞噪音；Claude Code 对「单文件大到压缩后立即再满」的场景会停止自动压缩并报错以防空转（同上文档）——按需供给同样需要这种熔断思维。</li>\n<li><strong>隔离大输出</strong>：日志分析、全量测试这类高吞吐操作交给 sub-agent，主对话只接收结论摘要。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>混合形态已有可复制的范本：Claude Code 的 auto memory 用「薄索引常驻 + 重内容按需」组织自身记忆——每次会话只装载 <code>MEMORY.md</code> 的前 200 行或 25KB（先到为准），细节放在独立条目文件里等模型去读（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Memory 文档</a>）。团队知识库完全可以套用同一形状：一份精炼索引常驻窗口，正文一律走检索路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>工具选型上优先精确检索（glob/grep 类）加定点阅读，其次才是语义检索；动态代码库慎用 embedding 索引——它会安静地过期。</li>\n<li>认真写每个 MCP 工具的 name 与 description：tool search 依靠它们匹配，描述含糊等于工具不存在。</li>\n<li>根目录维护两层入口：<code>AGENTS.md</code> 服务「每次都要的」，<code>llms.txt</code> 式地图服务「按需找的」。</li>\n<li>长任务的中间产物落盘成文件并记录行号，让后续步骤引用位置而不是重读整段。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>按需上下文把供给问题从「预测」改为「响应」：协议（MCP 的 resources/tools 二分）、运行时（tool search、skills、sub-agent）、仓库（可搜索性）三层机制都已现成，剩下的工作是把常驻层砍到最小、把检索路径修平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../the-context-artifacts/llms-txt-and-machine-readable-docs\">llms.txt 与机器可读文档</a>：实践要点中「llms.txt 式入口地图」的具体规范——格式区块、v2 发现挂钩与成本账。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../structuring-and-delivering-context/managing-the-context-window\">管理上下文窗口</a>：按需供给省下的预算花在哪、何时仍需压缩兜底——预算纪律的另一面。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"检索与按需上下文","id":"检索与按需上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预装 vs 按需","id":"预装-vs-按需"},{"level":2,"text":"协议层的按需投放：MCP","id":"协议层的按需投放-mcp"},{"level":2,"text":"让代码库支持高效检索","id":"让代码库支持高效检索"},{"level":2,"text":"策略与边界","id":"策略与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"管理上下文窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/managing-the-context-window"},"next":{"title":"保持上下文新鲜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/maintaining-context-over-time/keeping-context-fresh"}}